    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You often know where exactly to look for what you’re after, whether it’s an item or a book. You gain the Expeditious Search and Bookmark general feat, even though you do not meet their requirements. When you Search, search for a passage you have read before or Decipher Writing, you instead do these tasks four times as quickly in places or books and catalogues that are well organized (or eight times if you are Legendary in Perception).</span></p>"
